{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>YHWH guards the strangers</b> — for they have no helper, for they are from another nation." "And the word יעודד — I have explained it." "And the meaning of יעות — that He brings about causes. And it is possible: He devises plots to make their way crooked, that He not fulfill their request nor their desire be."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 146, :notes {2 "Reading עלילות as 'plots/devisings' and לעות as a causative infinitive 'to make crooked'; the passage is compressed and the syntax is uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:42:57.569489384Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}